{"symbol":"AAPLUSTRAD","yahoo":"AAPLUSTRAD.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"AA Plus Tradelink Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","website":"https://www.aaplustradelink.in","about":"AA Plus Tradelink Limited trades in products made of iron and steel, aluminum, graphite, and other alloy products. The company offers aluminium bars, rods and profiles, aluminium powder, aluminium scrap, aluminium molybdenum, GI pipes, graphite flakes and circles, graphite powder, graphite rods, blocks and plates, graphite scrap, graphite square and round products, MS pipes, MS sheets, matrix powder, nickel powder, tungsten, and zirconium alloy. It is also involved in the supply of epoxy floor coating, industrial epoxy floor coating, epoxy floor coating marine, PU floor coating, epoxy coating, epoxy primer, epoxy high build coating, and epoxy heat resistance coating. The company serves construction and manufacturing industry. AA Plus Tradelink Limited was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T07:24:19+00:00","quote":{"price":1.17,"prevClose":1.17,"marketCap":28.46,"high52":1.5,"low52":0.76,"pe":6.5,"bookValue":1.81,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":1.03,"shares":24.3248,"insiders":84.1,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-07-22","2021-07-23","2021-07-26","2021-07-27","2021-07-28","2021-07-29","2021-07-30","2021-08-02","2021-08-03","2021-08-04","2021-08-05","2021-08-06","2021-08-09","2021-08-10","2021-08-11","2021-08-12","2021-08-13","2021-08-16","2021-08-17","2021-08-18","2021-08-20","2021-08-23","2021-08-24","2021-08-25","2021-08-26","2021-08-27","2021-08-30","2021-08-31","2021-09-01","2021-09-02","2021-09-03","2021-09-06","2021-09-07","2021-09-08","2021-09-09","2021-09-13","2021-09-14","2021-09-15","2021-09-16","2021-09-17","2021-09-20","2021-09-21","2021-09-22","2021-09-23","2021-09-24","2021-09-27","2021-09-28","2021-09-29","2021-09-30","2021-10-01","2021-10-04","2021-10-05","2021-10-06","2021-10-07","2021-10